<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n113802" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χερν-ής</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ῆτος</span>, 
			Dor.
		
		<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χερνάς</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ᾶτος</span>, ὁ, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>poor, needy,</i>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐν χερνῆσι δόμοις</span> &lt;*&gt;<i><span class="en">
				<u>El.</u>
				207
			</span></i> (lyr.); 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χερνῆτα βίον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>AP</u>
					6.39
				</span></i>
			 (<i><span class="en">
				Arch.
			</span></i>); with fem. Subst., <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">&lt;&gt;νὴ χ.</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				Gal.
			</span></i> ap. <i><span class="en">
				Orib.
			</span></i>inc.<i><span class="en">
				22(6).13
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χέρνης</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hsch.
				</span></i>
			, but 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χερνής</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hdn.
				</span></i>
			 &lt;*&gt;.<i><span class="en">
				1.64
			</span></i>; fem. <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χερνῆσσα</span></b> 
				ib.<i><span class="en">
				1.250
			</span></i>. (Acc. to <i><span class="en">
				Hsch.
			</span></i> from <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χέρνα,</span>
				&lt;*&gt;<i>verty</i>: but acc. to <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>Pol.</u>
				1277a38
			</span></i>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὁ ζῶν ἀπὸ τῶν χειρῶν.</span>)</div>
